</div><div id="w-node-_56d75e37-85b4-d469-5cd9-ba14a5a6c7da-d52a29fb" class="faq_cta"><p data-text-anim="p">Still got unanswered questions? </p><a data-wf--animated-button--variant="internal-link" href="../contact" class="btn-icon-link w-inline-block"><div class="btn-icon-content w-variant-971fe11d-122c-1da4-2249-45c7ff19d90c"><div class="btn-icon-content__mask w-variant-971fe11d-122c-1da4-2249-45c7ff19d90c"><span data-button-anim-target="" class="u-text-style-eyebrow">Speak to us</span></div><div data-icon-size="normal" class="btn-icon-icon"><div data-button-anim-target="" class="btn-icon-icon__bg"></div><div class="btn-icon-icon__wrap"><div class="btn-icon-icon__list"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none" data-button-anim-target="" class="btn-icon-icon__arrow"><path d="M4.45231 0.385986H6.02531L9.30131 3.99999L6.02531 7.61399H4.45231L7.40331 4.58499H0.695312V3.42799H7.41631L4.45231 0.385986Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none" data-button-anim-target="" class="btn-icon-icon__arrow"><path d="M4.45231 0.385986H6.02531L9.30131 3.99999L6.02531 7.61399H4.45231L7.40331 4.58499H0.695312V3.42799H7.41631L4.45231 0.385986Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="100%" viewBox="0 0 10 8" fill="none" data-button-anim-target="" class="btn-icon-icon__arrow"><path d="M4.45231 0.385986H6.02531L9.30131 3.99999L6.02531 7.61399H4.45231L7.40331 4.58499H0.695312V3.42799H7.41631L4.45231 0.385986Z" fill="currentColor"></path></svg></div></div></div><div data-button-anim-target="" class="btn-icon-content__bg w-variant-971fe11d-122c-1da4-2249-45c7ff19d90c"></div></div></a></div><div id="w-node-_56d75e37-85b4-d469-5cd9-ba14a5a6c7df-d52a29fb" class="faq_content"><div class="accordion_wrap w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="accordion_list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="faq_item w-dyn-item"><div role="listitem" class="accordion_item"><div class="accordion_component"><h3 class="accordion_toggle_heading"><button aria-expanded="false" class="accordion_toggle_button"><span data-text-anim="header" class="accordion_toggle_text u-text-style-h5">How can we make sure the final product is used effectively?</span><span class="accordion_toggle_icon"><svg data-wf--icon-arrow--direction="bottom" viewBox="0 0 66 70" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" class="u-svg w-variant-caa8b8e9-e8ec-6eb3-4526-30f19f7326f5"><path d="M17 2L50 34.9999L17 68" class="u-path"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div class="accordion_content_wrap"><div class="accordion_content_padding"><div class="accordion_content_text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We work with you to ensure your deliverables – whether photography, video or aerial footage – are deployed to maximum effect. The content we create is designed to work seamlessly across your assets, from website to socials to digital ads.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="faq_item w-dyn-item"><div role="listitem" class="accordion_item"><div class="accordion_component"><h3 class="accordion_toggle_heading"><button aria-expanded="false" class="accordion_toggle_button"><span data-text-anim="header" class="accordion_toggle_text u-text-style-h5">What does the process of working with you look like?</span><span class="accordion_toggle_icon"><svg data-wf--icon-arrow--direction="bottom" viewBox="0 0 66 70" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" class="u-svg w-variant-caa8b8e9-e8ec-6eb3-4526-30f19f7326f5"><path d="M17 2L50 34.9999L17 68" class="u-path"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div class="accordion_content_wrap"><div class="accordion_content_padding"><div class="accordion_content_text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>It always starts with a narrative workshop to uncover authentic stories that reflect your brand. We then develop a concept for your photography or videography project. This is followed by collaborative ideation – creative sessions that fully involve the stakeholders of your business, ensuring that you’re in charge of the process and that we stay closely in tune with your brand throughout.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="faq_item w-dyn-item"><div role="listitem" class="accordion_item"><div class="accordion_component"><h3 class="accordion_toggle_heading"><button aria-expanded="false" class="accordion_toggle_button"><span data-text-anim="header" class="accordion_toggle_text u-text-style-h5">Can you work within our existing brand guidelines?</span><span class="accordion_toggle_icon"><svg data-wf--icon-arrow--direction="bottom" viewBox="0 0 66 70" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" class="u-svg w-variant-caa8b8e9-e8ec-6eb3-4526-30f19f7326f5"><path d="M17 2L50 34.9999L17 68" class="u-path"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div class="accordion_content_wrap"><div class="accordion_content_padding"><div class="accordion_content_text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>Absolutely. We get the need for close brand alignment, especially for businesses with a global reach. We’ll work respectfully with your brand managers and marketing strategists to ensure that our work is consistent with your existing output – while also helping to elevate your brand through the power of beautiful imagery.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div role="listitem" class="faq_item w-dyn-item"><div role="listitem" class="accordion_item"><div class="accordion_component"><h3 class="accordion_toggle_heading"><button aria-expanded="false" class="accordion_toggle_button"><span data-text-anim="header" class="accordion_toggle_text u-text-style-h5">What range of services can you provide for our brand?</span><span class="accordion_toggle_icon"><svg data-wf--icon-arrow--direction="bottom" viewBox="0 0 66 70" fill="none" width="100%" height="100%" aria-hidden="true" class="u-svg w-variant-caa8b8e9-e8ec-6eb3-4526-30f19f7326f5"><path d="M17 2L50 34.9999L17 68" class="u-path"></path></svg></span></button></h3><div class="accordion_content_wrap"><div class="accordion_content_padding"><div class="accordion_content_text u-rich-text w-richtext"><p>We offer high-end photography, videography and drone footage capture – but also a wide spectrum of services relating to these fields. These include editing and post-production, sound design and mixing, and colour grading to ensure the best possible results. We can also bring in editors, animators, stylists, music composers and other specialists whose work we know and trust.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="u-embed-css w-embed"><style>
.wf-design-mode .accordion_content_wrap {
	display: block;
}
</style></div><div class="u-embed-js w-embed w-script"><script>
document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function () {
  document.querySelectorAll(".accordion_wrap").forEach((component, listIndex) => {
    if (component.dataset.scriptInitialized) return;
    component.dataset.scriptInitialized = "true";

    const closePrevious = component.getAttribute("data-close-previous") !== "false";
    const closeOnSecondClick = component.getAttribute("data-close-on-second-click") !== "false";
    const openOnHover = component.getAttribute("data-open-on-hover") === "true";
    const openByDefault = component.getAttribute("data-open-by-default") !== null && !isNaN(+component.getAttribute("data-open-by-default")) ? +component.getAttribute("data-open-by-default") : false;
		const list = component.querySelector(".accordion_list");
    let previousIndex = null,
      closeFunctions = [];

    function removeCMSList(slot) {
      const dynList = Array.from(slot.children).find((child) => child.classList.contains("w-dyn-list"));
      if (!dynList) return;
      const nestedItems = dynList?.firstElementChild?.children;
      if (!nestedItems) return;
      const staticWrapper = [...slot.children];
      [...nestedItems].forEach(el => el.firstElementChild && slot.appendChild(el.firstElementChild));
      staticWrapper.forEach((el) => el.remove());
    }
    removeCMSList(list);

    component.querySelectorAll(".accordion_component").forEach((card, cardIndex) => {
      const button = card.querySelector(".accordion_toggle_button");
      const content = card.querySelector(".accordion_content_wrap");

      if (!button || !content) return console.warn("Missing elements:", card);

      button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
      button.setAttribute("id", "accordion_button_" + listIndex + "_" + cardIndex);
      content.setAttribute("id", "accordion_content_" + listIndex + "_" + cardIndex);
      button.setAttribute("aria-controls", content.id);
      content.setAttribute("aria-labelledby", button.id);
      content.style.display = "none";

      const refresh = () => {
        tl.invalidate();
        if (typeof ScrollTrigger !== "undefined") ScrollTrigger.refresh();
      };
      const tl = gsap.timeline({ paused: true, defaults: { duration: 0.3, ease: "power1.inOut" }, onComplete: refresh, onReverseComplete: refresh });
      tl.set(content, { display: "block" });
      tl.fromTo(content, { height: 0 }, { height: "auto" });

      const closeAccordion = () => card.classList.contains("is-active") && (card.classList.remove("is-active"), tl.reverse(), button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false"));
      closeFunctions[cardIndex] = closeAccordion;

      const openAccordion = (instant = false) => {
        if (closePrevious && previousIndex !== null && previousIndex !== cardIndex) closeFunctions[previousIndex]?.();
        previousIndex = cardIndex;
        button.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true");
        card.classList.add("is-active");
        instant ? tl.progress(1) : tl.play();
      };
      if (openByDefault === cardIndex + 1) openAccordion(true);

      button.addEventListener("click", () => (card.classList.contains("is-active") && closeOnSecondClick ? (closeAccordion(), (previousIndex = null)) : openAccordion()));
      if (openOnHover) button.addEventListener("mouseenter", () => openAccordion());
    });
  });
});
</script></div></div></div></div></section><section class="content_what"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer u-container w-container"><div class="what_wrap"><div class="what_title"><h4 class="u-text-style-h3">See the full picture.</h4></div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="what_list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="what_item w-dyn-item"><a data-underline-link="" href="photography" class="w-inline-block"><h2 class="u-text-style-h4">Photography</h2></a></div><div role="listitem" class="what_item w-dyn-item"><a data-underline-link="" href="videography" class="w-inline-block"><h2 class="u-text-style-h4">Videography</h2></a></div><div role="listitem" class="what_item w-dyn-item"><a data-underline-link="" href="drone" class="w-inline-block"><h2 class="u-text-style-h4">Drone Footage</h2></a></div><div role="listitem" class="what_item w-dyn-item"><a data-underline-link="" href="partnerships" class="w-inline-block"><h2 class="u-text-style-h4">Partnerships</h2></a></div></div></div><div class="what_client_wrap"><div class="u-text-style-eyebrow">For</div><div class="w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="what_list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="what_item w-dyn-item"><a data-underline-link="" href="local" class="w-inline-block"><h2 class="u-text-style-h4">Local Businesses</h2></a></div><div role="listitem" class="what_item w-dyn-item"><a data-underline-link="" href="global" aria-current="page" class="w-inline-block w--current"><h2 class="u-text-style-h4">Global Brands</h2></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section data-momentum-hover-init="" class="content_cta"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer u-container w-container"><div class="cta_block"><div class="cta_content"><h3 data-text-anim="header" class="u-text-style-h1">Let&#x27;s roll.</h3><p data-text-anim="p">Ready to bring your story to life through cinematic photography and video? We’d love to collaborate.</p><a data-wf--animated-button--variant="internal-link" href="../contact"